Players can customize three parts of their [[farmhouse]]s: the [[Customization/Farmhouse#Roof|roof]], the [[Customization/Farmhouse#Walls|walls]] and the [[Customization/Farmhouse#Porch|porch]]. This lists available options.

There are 88 options overall, including the original three: 38 for roofs, 34 for walls and 16 for porches.

The star icon (★) denotes options which are part of a [[Customization/Style Book|style]].
